docs {
  # Submit TACOTS Tracking
  
  Submits a midterm or end-of-term tracking report for a TACOTS beneficiary. The form captures academic performance, character formation ratings, mentorship session details, community service activities, financial expenditure, and required file uploads (term result and optional payment evidence).
  
  On success, the tracking record is saved to the database. The endpoint returns the newly created tracking object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  ### Identification & Period
  
  | Field            | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                 |
  |------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentId        | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS student record                            |
  | schoolId         | string | Yes      | UUID of the enrolled school record                           |
  | region           | string | Yes      | Valid Nigerian state (e.g. `ABIA`, `LAGOS`, `FCT`)           |
  | academicSession  | string | Yes      | Academic session format (e.g. `2024/2025`)                   |
  | academicTerm     | string | Yes      | One of: `1ST TERM`, `2ND TERM`, `3RD TERM`                  |
  | assessmentPeriod | string | Yes      | One of: `MIDTERM`, `END OF TERM`                             |
  | submissionDate   | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                        |
  
  ### Academic Performance
  
  | Field                  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values   |
  |------------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------|
  | highestSubjectScore    | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                 |
  | lowestSubjectScore     | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                 |
  | studentAveragePct      | number | Yes      | Numeric value                  |
  | studentPositionInClass | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                 |
  | academicComment        | string | No       | Optional free text             |
  
  ### Character Formation
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values   |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------|
  | socialBehaviorRating | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`        |
  | schoolRulesRating    | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`        |
  | responsibilityRating | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`        |
  | formationComments    | string | No       | Optional free text             |
  
  ### Mentorship
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                     |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | mentorName           | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                   |
  | mentorshipSessionDate| date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                            |
  | mentorshipMode       | string | Yes      | One of: `PHYSICAL (IN-PERSON)`, `VIRTUAL (ONLINE)`                               |
  | mentorshipDuration   | string | Yes      | One of: `15 MINUTES`, `30 MINUTES`, `45 MINUTES`, `60 MINUTES`, `MORE THAN 60 MINUTES` |
  | mentorshipNotes      | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                   |
  
  ### Community Service
  
  | Field               | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                |
  |---------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | serviceActivityType | string | Yes      | One of: `ENVIRONMENTAL SANITATION`, `TEACHING YOUNGER CHILDREN`, `CHURCH / COMMUNITY SUPPORT`, `HELPING ELDERLY PERSONS`, `SCHOOL VOLUNTEERING`, `OTHER` |
  | serviceDate         | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                                                                                       |
  | serviceDuration     | string | Yes      | One of: `30 MINS`, `1 HOUR`, `2 HOURS`, `3 HOURS`, `4 HOURS`, `5 HOURS`, `MORE THAN 5 HOURS`                                              |
  | serviceDescription  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                              |
  | serviceSupervisor   | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                              |
  
  ### Financial Summary
  
  | Field            | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values   |
  |------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------|
  | tuitionFeePaid   | number | Yes      | Numeric value                  |
  | resourcesSpent   | number | Yes      | Numeric value                  |
  | sundriesSpent    | number | Yes      | Numeric value                  |
  | totalAmountSpent | number | Yes      | Numeric value                  |
  | financialNotes   | string | No       | Optional free text             |
  
  ## File Uploads
  
  | Field           | MIME Types Accepted | Required | Notes                                                                                   |
  |-----------------|---------------------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | termResult      | PDF, image          | **Yes**  | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/TACOTS-ASSETS/TERM-RESULTS` on Cloudinary            |
  | paymentEvidence | PDF, image          | No       | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/TACOTS-ASSETS/PAYMENT-EVIDENCE` on Cloudinary        |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created TACOTS tracking record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `400 Bad Request`           | No files were attached to the request.                                |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                              |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `create` permission.                               |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Cloudinary upload failed for `termResult`.                            |
}
